7820: ## set_temp_variable
7821: 
7822: * Supported Scopes: any
7823: * Supported Targets: none
7824: 
7825: Sets a temp variable to a value, another variable, or a [math expression](script_math_expression.md).
7826: `tooltip` can be used to override tooltip title with LEFT and RIGHT tokens.
7827: 
7828: ### Examples
7829: ```
7830: set_temp_variable = { num_dogs = 42 }
7831: set_temp_variable = {
7832: 	var = num_dogs
7833: 	value = 42
7834: 	tooltip = loc_str_id_with_LEFT_and_RIGHT
7835: }
7836: set_temp_variable = {
7837: 	num_dogs = { value = num_cats  multiply = 2  add = 1 }
7838: }
7839: ```

